Note on scope: this license covers the plugin's own content (skills, rules,
templates, scripts, indexes, examples). It does not cover Ukrainian
normative documents (ДСТУ, ДБН, ПУЕ) or manufacturer documentation, which
are not distributed with this repository; users supply those to the
untracked references/local/ layer under the documents' own terms. Brief
attributed quotations of normative wording in example files are used for
illustration of the citation format.

The engineering content is provided for planning assistance only and does
not constitute certified design documentation.
